Z||000005||batboy||07-29-2000||07:00 PM||||My caver friends nicknamed me Batboy long before I got online. My master's thesis was about cavern development in Kansas and I like bats...the little furry critters. They are very misunderstood and gentle creatures. Nearly all of the bats in the U.S. are insect eaters, chomping down on mainly skeeters, moths and other nocturnal bugs. Anything that kills skeeters is a friend of mine. If you want to link the Batmobile website, the URL is in my profile.||||reg||1
